      <activity id="985a97c8-8862-5922-b974-7a4c5391cb73" activityNameId="34449cae-9d39-5d51-b169-2c574ddaf08b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at wind power plant Grenchenberg 150kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at wind power plant Grenchenberg 150kW
The capacity factor is assumed to be 10.5 %, based on electricity proction statistics from this specific wind power plant, installed 1994 in Grenchenberg, Switzerland. Gear oil has to be changed every second year. The lifetime of moving and fixed parts is assumed to be 20 resp. 40 years.;
UUID: 85e23a9e-8109-3521-bd6f-efcada420b37
Includes the operation of the wind power plant with the necessary change of gear oil. Also includes the capacity factor, concerning the wind conditions
Location: Data for a specific Swiss wind power plant. Could be used for other alpine regions with similar wind conditions. 
Technology: Technology of a specific 150 kW wind power plant
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and statistics. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_85e23a9e-8109-3521-bd6f-efcada420b37.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
